AWE — Agentic Workflow Essentials
=================================

AWE incorporates material adapted from agent-skills
(https://github.com/addyosmani/agent-skills), Copyright (c) 2025 Addy Osmani,
MIT License.

The following AWE components adapt content from that project (each ported file
also carries a one-line attribution header):

  Skills (template/.cursor/skills/):
  - awe-smoke/SKILL.md             (debugging-and-error-recovery, test-driven-development, test-engineer)
  - awe-regression/SKILL.md        (debugging-and-error-recovery, test-driven-development)
  - awe-code/SKILL.md              (test-driven-development)
  - awe-review/SKILL.md            (code-review-and-quality, doubt-driven-development, code-simplification)
  - awe-approve/SKILL.md           (interview-me — explicit-yes / hedged-approval discipline)
  - awe-intake/SKILL.md            (interview-me)
  - awe-architect/SKILL.md         (planning-and-task-breakdown, context-engineering)
  - awe-ship/SKILL.md              (shipping-and-launch, documentation-and-adrs)
  - awe-remember/SKILL.md          (documentation-and-adrs, context-engineering)

  Agents (template/.cursor/agents/):
  - awe-reviewer.md                (code-review-and-quality, doubt-driven-development)
  - awe-security-reviewer.md       (security-and-hardening)
  - awe-smoke-tester.md            (test-engineer)
  - awe-fullstack-dev.md           (frontend-ui-engineering, api-and-interface-design, incremental-implementation)

  Hooks (template/.cursor/hooks/):
  - constraints-guard.mjs          (constraint-driven-development — the "guard the bar" checks)
  - pre-tool-gate.mjs              (planning-and-task-breakdown — the never-clobber-an-incomplete-plan rule)

  References (template/.cursor/skills/references/):
  - definition-of-done.md          (references/definition-of-done.md)
  - debugging-triage.md            (debugging-and-error-recovery)
  - review-rubric.md               (code-review-and-quality)
  - security-review-checklist.md   (security-and-hardening)
  - ship-decision.md               (shipping-and-launch, documentation-and-adrs)
  - plan-task-template.md          (planning-and-task-breakdown)
  - project-briefing.md            (context-engineering, documentation-and-adrs)
  - smoke-e2e.md                   (test-engineer, test-driven-development)

  Other:
  - template/CONSTRAINTS.md        (constraint-driven-development)

